<title>USA: Santander names Sao Paulo analyst.</title>
<headline>Santander names Sao Paulo analyst.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment said on Wednesday it had named Sergio Goldman vice president and head of Brazilian equity research.</p>
<p>Goldman is based in Sao Paulo. Before joining Santander, he worked for Paribas and managed the firm's research team in Brazil.</p>
<p>In 1996 Goldman was ranked No 3 for Brazilian equity research in Institutional Investor magazine.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
